---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SLCP Verification & Social Compliance Services | Eurocert"
  description="SLCP Social & Labor Convergence Protocol verification — converged assessment framework (CAF) data collection and verification by Eurocert Asia for supply-chain due diligence."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/slcp/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367929/eurocert/b6.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="SLCP Social &amp; Labor Convergence Program"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Converged Assessment Framework for Social &amp; Labor Conditions</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">SLCP — <span class="text-eurogold-400">Social &amp; Labor Convergence Program</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">A simple, unified and effective industry-wide assessment framework to objectively assess social and labor conditions and replace proprietary tools</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">About SLCP</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">SLCP?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">SLCP has developed a simple, unified and effective industry-wide assessment framework. This has resulted in a descriptive (standard-agnostic) tool and verification methodology to collect relevant and essential data with the intent to objectively assess social and labor conditions and replace current proprietary tools.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">SLCP is not a standard and does not provide certification.</strong> The Converged Assessment Framework is a descriptive (standard-agnostic) tool and verification methodology to collect relevant and essential data with the intent to objectively assess social and labor conditions.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Eurocert — Approved Verifier Body</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert is an approved training provider and an Approved Verifying Body for SLCP. Our verified assessments help facilities demonstrate social and labor compliance to multiple stakeholders through a single assessment.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367929/eurocert/b6.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="SLCP Social &amp; Labor Convergence Program"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-server text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">What is an Accredited Host?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">There are two types of Accredited Hosts: <strong class="text-slate-700">active and passive</strong>. The active Accredited Hosts include:</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Fair Factories Clearinghouse</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Higg Co</span></li></ul></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-user-check text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Who Does the Verification?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">SLCP approved Verifier Body selects the verifier who will do the verification. Eurocert is an approved Verifying Body authorized to conduct SLCP verifications.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-database text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Who Owns the Data?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">The facility owns the verified data</strong> and they can decide whom to share it with. This puts facilities in control of their own compliance information.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Assessment Process</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">Self Assessment in SLCP?</span></h2></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="space-y-5"><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">SLCP asks facilities to do a self/joint-assessment first. Not only does it allow for a full understanding of their working conditions, it also:</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-white text-xs"></i></div><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Gives facilities a better understanding of where gaps might be</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-white text-xs"></i></div><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Helps facilities understand how they can best improve working conditions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-white text-xs"></i></div><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Empowers facilities to take ownership and control over the improvement of workers&#x27; working conditions</span></li></ul><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">After the self/joint-assessment, an SLCP approved verifier is sent to verify its accuracy and create a complete and validated set of data. Then, the facility can decide with whom they want to share their verified data.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-tasks text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">How to Do the Self Assessment?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Facilities need to gather data from the <strong class="text-slate-700">previous 12 months</strong> to answer the Data Collection Tool&#x27;s questions.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">In general, completing a self/joint-assessment takes around <strong class="text-slate-700">two weeks</strong> the first time. With experience this can be done faster. The Facility Guidance document is key to complete the assessment efficiently and with high quality.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Using the online platform for data collection, facilities can attach applicable photographs/documents for every question on the Tool. Note that all attachments are included in the verified assessment report shared with end users, so you should not include records that you do not want them to see.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Data Collection Tool</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">10 Sections of <span class="text-euro-600">SLCP Data Tool</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">01</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Facility Profile</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">02</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Recruitment and Hiring</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">03</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Working Hours</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">04</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Wages and Benefits</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">05</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Worker Treatment</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">06</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Worker Involvement</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">07</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Health and Safety</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">08</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Termination</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">09</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Management Systems</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">10</span></div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Above and Beyond</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Getting Started</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">How to Start the <span class="text-euro-600">SLCP Process?</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10"><div class="p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">01</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Register</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Register and create your profile on the Gateway</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">02</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Link Host</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Link to an Accredited Host</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">03</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Create Profile</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Create your profile on the Accredited Host</p></div></div><div class="text-center mb-6"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Assessment Levels</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Choose Your <span class="text-euro-600">Step Level</span></h3></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Essential</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Covers key social &amp; labor compliance questions, mostly connected to International Labor Standards (ILS) and National Labor Law (NLL).</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Progressive</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Focuses on management systems and supportive social &amp; labor compliance questions often found in social industry and certification standards. Includes all Step 1 questions.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Advanced</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Covers questions that go above and beyond social responsibility industry standards, seeking to elevate workplace well-being and community impact. Includes all Step 1 and Step 2 questions.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Verification Process</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Facility&#x27;s <span class="text-eurogold-400">Responsibility</span></h3><p class="text-white/40 text-sm mt-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">The facility is responsible for facilitating a successful verification</p></div><div class="space-y-3 mb-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">01</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Completing the self/joint-assessment and attaching documentation through the Accredited Host platform</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">02</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Providing necessary information for cost estimation to the Verifier Body, including whether the facility wishes to include virtual verification activities</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">03</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Working together with the Verifier Body/Verifier to schedule the verification over consecutive days</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">04</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Support the Verifier during on-site verification — providing access to the facility, showing all relevant documentation and sites, introducing appropriate personnel including for worker interviews</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">05</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ironing out any concerns or questions about the verification ideally while the Verifier is on-site or latest 48 hours after the on-site verification ends</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle text-eurogold-400 text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-eurogold-400">Note:</strong> If a facility does not support the verification, e.g. denies a Verifier access to information, sites or workers, the Verifier needs to make note of this in the Verification Details section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-video text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Virtual Verification</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">SLCP permits Verifiers to conduct virtual verification activities in order to reduce the time spent on-site. Virtual verifications can include:</p><ul class="space-y-2 mb-4"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Pre-verification meetings</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Opening meetings</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Documentation reviews</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Virtual interviews to further understand documents shared</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Virtual walk-throughs</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Partial wage and hours records review</span></li></ul><div class="p-3 bg-euro-50/40 rounded-xl border border-euro-100"><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">Requirements:</strong> All virtual activities must be completed before on-site verification begins. The same Verifier(s) must be involved in both. It is always the facility&#x27;s decision to permit virtual activities.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Can a Factory Dispute?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">A facility can dispute the outcome of the verification on the Accredited Host platform if there are quality and/or integrity issues related to the Verifier&#x27;s conduct or if the verification did not follow the Verification Protocol. Disputes cannot be raised at question level.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Once disputed, the Verification Oversight Organization (VOO) is notified and will begin an investigation, hearing all parties involved to come to a ruling.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-project-diagram text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Subcontracting in SLCP</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">A &quot;subcontractor&quot; is an entity or person not part of the facility but used to complete part or all of the production process. A subcontractor is NOT a labor recruiter/agency, service provider, or materials supplier.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">If subcontractors are working in the facility, the facility is subject to questions related to subcontractors. If they work in production, they are considered within the scope of &quot;production worker&quot;.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Approved Verifying Body</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose <span class="text-eurogold-400">Eurocert?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in social and labour compliance verification and SLCP-aligned facility assessments.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">SLCP Approved</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Eurocert is an <strong class="text-white/70">approved training provider</strong> and an <strong class="text-white/70">Approved Verifying Body</strong> for SLCP.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our verified assessments help facilities streamline social compliance, reduce audit fatigue, and share one assessment across multiple stakeholders.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span> — a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Success Rate</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/sedex"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367912/eurocert/b2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5